am":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jnf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A452F36D-AD7F-4E1D-8596-68475252CA14","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttp://chugokugo-script.net/kiso/tenki.html|http://chugokugo-script.net/kiso/tenki.html\u003e","ts":"1628864391.425900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zrPb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F8A93EF6-A804-4B7A-9489-19BA642407B0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"だったっぽい","ts":"1628864374.425800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TUUU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"314C0310-1150-4C42-9AEE-BF676E146952","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"摄氏","ts":"1628864370.425600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zft="}]},{"client_msg_id":"329db4f9-93d6-44e5-8f28-a516b809cd33","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"華氏、アメリカとかヨーロッパ圏だけかと思っていた","ts":"1628864217.425400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jZR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"788d6b9f-b23d-48a3-a228-5130762f7fd1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"記憶違いかもだけど℃ではなかったなのは確か","ts":"1628864213.425300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w0R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aab2ce0e-cbf0-4ab0-a074-21819aae219f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"へえ","ts":"1628864152.424300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lts"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0c80750-ec86-4591-b30e-d95632a9eba0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そういえば中国の天気予報だと華氏を使っていた記憶","ts":"1628864135.423700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cn3B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0951cdca-7858-4347-8e8c-a940c0c99774","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"華氏の場合は 100°F が発熱している人間の体温の目安だった気がします。摂氏でいう 37.8℃。\n華氏を使う人にとって、ここがはたしてボーダーラインなのかはよく知りませんが","ts":"1628863851.422400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F=m4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9518b400-fe19-4658-bf9f-bc663ce824ed","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"やっぱそれぐらいがボーダーラインですよね。＞ 37.5℃以上","ts":"1628863666.419800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pk87"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9948da85-a098-4ac5-b27f-64176d582b14","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.mhlw.go.jp/content/000739391.pdf\u003e\n予防接種を受けることができない人\n• 明らかに発熱している人（（※1）明らかな発熱とは通常 37.5℃以上を指します。ただし、37.5℃を下回る場合も平時の体温を鑑みて発熱と判断される場合はこの限りではありません。）\nとのことです。熱が下がらないと受けれない。。","ts":"1628863447.417900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p8guV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"120f69cf-4b10-4fd7-9e97-8a7c59d36ac1","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"38℃以上が発熱での危険ラインなんでしたっけ？","ts":"1628863336.416900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PUc8a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47fb7ed8-9761-4aec-a86a-6f97e50173f1","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あとはワクチンの副作用がどれぐらい出るか…来週やっと一回目の接種してくるので。","ts":"1628863251.416200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1T6a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09f60206-7e01-4599-9dea-78e2878ca197","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そうですね。37.5はさすがにどんなに平常でも行かないはず","ts":"1628863108.415400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+286f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31293248-3232-4d8b-88fb-502a7e115b47","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"微熱というか発熱をというか、まあ気にはしたほうがいいでしょうね","ts":"1628863103.415300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gcHW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a35ce861-69b2-4eb8-894a-d363c9b0d10f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"一般的な店舗で立ち入りを遠慮してくださいと書かれてる「37.5℃以上」になったら微熱を疑うべきなのかもしれませんね。","ts":"1628863076.414400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VV0eV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d23aea3-aba4-457e-b841-2572a20da887","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"たとえば私は体温が35度台になったことありません","ts":"1628863062.414100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n9EOt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85a0a491-6531-469a-8c7f-9e01ca8b1c20","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"平熱高い人はいますよ。私もそうです","ts":"1628863004.412600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UVn7w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faf9e305-8ec3-4d57-8dd0-e4da0f23b0ec","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"解熱鎮痛薬を飲んで安静にしてたら熱っぽさも無くなってマシになったけど、今測っても36.6℃と出てきたから平均体温が高い方なのかも。","ts":"1628862977.412200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da37f96c-fb49-45be-a581-a411c38a19c3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"36.5以上くらいが微熱かな...?\nただ、平熱ってようは平均値みたいな所あるので、問題ないなら高めも低めもいますからね35.5くらいが普段とか","ts":"1628862772.410700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JnR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"237ca28a-a9d0-4615-9d8a-d83e78ce3065","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"個人差はあれど少し心配になってきた。といって二ヶ月前に受けたPCR検査では陰性と返ってきてたけど。","ts":"1628862720.409800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rwGtJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9412dea3-eeb3-45f3-be8c-8d88e93dce22","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あれ？37℃って微熱扱いなの…？だいたい36.7℃前後を指してる事が多かったからこれが平熱ぐらいだと思ってた。","ts":"1628862531.408800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X9a0c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c29e626-193b-4f79-91f6-ff2b07405db3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://togetter.com/li/1756937\u003e\n軽いならこれくらいなのかな","ts":"1628859922.406900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Togetter: ファイザー二回目接種の記録","id":1,"title":"ファイザー二回目接種の記録","title_link":"https://togetter.com/li/1756937","text":"幸いにして顕著な副反応は無かった","thumb_url":"https://s.togetter.com/ogp/dd5f1f34b444fb822c4c3888283f7753-1200x630.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Togetter","service_icon":"https://s.togetter.com/static/1.16.02/web/img/tg/icon/apple-icon-57x57.png","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":630,"from_url":"https://togetter.com/li/1756937","original_url":"https://togetter.com/li/1756937"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"woP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25cda97e-9ffb-4108-b73d-37090ad5729e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"気圧センサーマジでしんどいですね……\n朝起きる気が出なくて、いざ起きてみたら雨降ってて「ああ……」となる事幾星霜","ts":"1628856213.406400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"21I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"667949d3-cf61-46be-8eed-4b6fc76e613d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分の体に気圧センサーが搭載されていないという時点で運パラメーター使い果たしている気がする","ts":"1628855948.405500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FsYT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a968dc60-c38c-4ae6-aabd-c12c46c7af2c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"頭が重いわ吐き気もするわ何だか熱っぽいなと思って体温測ってみたら37.0℃（実測）